{"read_id": "READ-20261118-bb0f37", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-327b3d", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-158"}, "reading": "reinterpreted", "note": "Gutenberg #4198 固定版（1669年4月11日・24-25日・5月31日・編者序文）を直接照合し、日課・無読者要約を改訂。", "created_at": "2026-11-18"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261118-2d5bf7", "session_id": "SESSION-20261118-327b3d", "target": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261112-e24c67"}, "reading": "reinterpreted", "in_reply_to": ["READ-20261025-60be93"], "note": "10/24報告 §34 の編者要約依存を一次照合で補訂。", "created_at": "2026-11-18"}
